1421
00:59:51.270 --> 00:59:55.990
This seems like such a no-brainer to let your employees be proactive in their health.

1422
00:59:56.150 --> 00:59:56.490
Yes.

1423
00:59:56.490 --> 00:59:58.450
So get your screenings, everyone.

